{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_yuki_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_yuki_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "忍者之道",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_yuki_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4939bd993ecbd207b1ef25b5682fa9ec65464b45745e81ba67451d5b2e278970",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "小雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我和彦吾说过了，接下来，我会安排你以干员的身份进入一家叫罗德岛的医药公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "罗德岛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "对，你应该已经听说过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "我只听说小姐和他们关系很深。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "公主让我去保护小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "嗯......确实也有这样的想法，毕竟这是个由感染者建立的组织，不过我想晖洁应该能自己处理好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "感染者......公主觉得可靠？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "嗯，放心，我见过他们的领袖，是个很不错的孩子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "而且我稍微观察了一下，感觉这是家不错的公司，所以觉得这是个好机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "机会？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "对，你从小跟随我，来到龙门后也没有离开过我的身边。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#5",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "这是我的使命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "但你也该去看看外面的风景了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "我只需要了解公主看到的风景。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerToken": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki_1",
      "operatorId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "这是命令，小雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白雪",
      "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
      "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
      "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
      "text": "白雪，依照文月公主的嘱托，协助陈小姐行动，并听从你的差遣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "欢迎你！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "4",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白雪",
          "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
          "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
          "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
          "text": "......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "5",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "观察了数天，博士，怪人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "用水壶直接在嘴里加热速食食品，天才。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "不过此人确实在指挥用人和处理各类事务上有相当的能力。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "以及，罗德岛，不可貌相。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "表面上是医药公司，实际上却近似军事组织，颇有实力，难怪魏公会和这家公司合作。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "公主虽然没有明说，但既然陈小姐在这里，想必是要我调查这个组织，以护小姐周全。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "除了博士，这里还有两个领导者。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "阿米娅我已见过，如公主所说，是个很亲切的人。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "但既然她能成为领导者，必有过人之处，不可掉以轻心。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "另一个叫凯尔希的人尚未见过，从他人谈话来看，此人才是这家公司的核心人物，需要对其有所了解。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "舰内可通行区域的大致构造已记在脑内，时间，凌晨一点，该行动了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "进来了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "罗德岛的管道设计，不错。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "条理有序，四通八达......还有相应的监控。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "但是这种程度，小意思。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "大部分通道与宿舍连接的接口都是厕所，只有部分窗口因为设计原因能看到宿舍内部的情况吗......合理。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "？？？",
              "speakerToken": "char_2013_cerber_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_2013_cerber",
              "portraitKey": "char_2013_cerber",
              "text": "呼啊......古米，我要吃肉......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "刻俄柏。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "睡相很差。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "月见夜",
              "speakerToken": "char_283_midn_1",
              "operatorId": "char_283_midn",
              "portraitKey": "char_283_midn",
              "text": "呼......很好，今天的训练量也达标了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "月见夜",
              "speakerToken": "char_283_midn_1",
              "operatorId": "char_283_midn",
              "portraitKey": "char_283_midn",
              "text": "时间也不早了，虽然明天没有任务，该做一下皮肤护理然后睡觉了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "月见夜",
              "speakerToken": "char_283_midn_1",
              "operatorId": "char_283_midn",
              "portraitKey": "char_283_midn",
              "text": "唉，自从成为干员后，外表的打理真是疏忽了不少。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "月见夜",
              "speakerToken": "char_283_midn_1",
              "operatorId": "char_283_midn",
              "portraitKey": "char_283_midn",
              "text": "不过也没办法，这也算是必要的牺牲吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "月见夜",
              "speakerToken": "char_283_midn_1",
              "operatorId": "char_283_midn",
              "portraitKey": "char_283_midn",
              "text": "而且，即使我不打理，也已经足够帅了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "（恶寒）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "干员代号，月见夜。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "自恋。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "不过，肌肉线条不错。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "......嗯？时间已经这么晚了吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex#4",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "算了，再坚持一下吧，克洛丝她们的训练方案快要设计好了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "年轻人的成长速度确实惊人，现在的她们已经和刚来到罗德岛时完全不一样了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "杜宾",
              "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex#2",
              "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
              "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
              "text": "呵，虽然距离我对她们的要求还差得远就是了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#5",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "教官杜宾。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#5",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "面冷心善。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "大部分人已经入睡。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......罗德岛的人，看起来多少都颇为适应在此处生活。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "确实如公主所说，是个好地方。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......前面就不是宿舍区了，小心行事。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "早露",
              "speakerToken": "char_197_poca_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_197_poca",
              "portraitKey": "char_197_poca",
              "text": "哈......哈......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凛冬",
              "speakerToken": "char_115_headbr_9",
              "operatorId": "char_115_headbr",
              "portraitKey": "char_115_headbr",
              "text": "娜塔莉娅......哦，现在应该叫你早露了，你该休息了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "早露",
              "speakerToken": "char_197_poca_1",
              "operatorId": "char_197_poca",
              "portraitKey": "char_197_poca",
              "text": "呼......你先去睡吧，我一个人再训练一下。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凛冬",
              "speakerToken": "char_115_headbr_9#2",
              "operatorId": "char_115_headbr",
              "portraitKey": "char_115_headbr",
              "text": "......算了，再陪你一会儿吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凛冬",
              "speakerToken": "char_115_headbr_9#2",
              "operatorId": "char_115_headbr",
              "portraitKey": "char_115_headbr",
              "text": "我让你活了下来，你要是随便死在战场上，那我也太丢脸了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "早露",
              "speakerToken": "char_197_poca_1",
              "operatorId": "char_197_poca",
              "portraitKey": "char_197_poca",
              "text": "啊哈，那就麻烦你了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "两个来自乌萨斯的学生，似乎是之前接收的难民。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "切尔诺伯格，惨剧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "祝你们好运。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "嗯？那是......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "阿米娅，今天的工作就先告一段落吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "好的，凯尔希医生。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "这个时间博士不知道睡了没有，我去看一眼吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "Dr.{@nickname}有自己的分寸。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "虽然是这么说，但是博士的身体健康也是很重要的！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "我看完博士就去睡觉，好不好，凯尔希医生？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "......随你。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "阿米娅",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#10",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "嗯！"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "这应当就是凯尔希医生......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#3",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "她似乎往这边看了一眼，被发现了？！"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "（她似乎没有发现我。但是刚才的感觉究竟是......）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "罢了，既然没有被发现，继续前进吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "（嗯？前面似乎有很强的噪音......方位上来推测，似乎是工程部。）"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "喂喂喂，不是吧，这里难道不应该直接亲上去吗！女主你在犹豫什么啊！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "啧，不是吧，这种桥段来一次就够了，别每次都这样啊，编剧你行不行啊！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "呜哇，是我最讨厌的发展方向......难怪这部剧能出到第七季而且评价越来越烂。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "这根本就是在拖时间好不好！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "......可恶，但是男主真的很帅。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "算了，再忍忍，说不定后面好看呢！"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "总工程师可露希尔。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "据说罗德岛的舰体就是她一手设计的，厉害。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "不过这部剧，真正的烂点还不在这里，第四季男配的突然登场才是噩梦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "啊？不是吧？！我还以为这够烂了！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......你听得到我说话？！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "啊，糟了，不小心接话了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "算了，你下来吧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......什么时候？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "一开始。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "啊，不要误会，你的忍者技巧确实还挺厉害的，只不过我一开始就知道你要做这件事啦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#3",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......这是我个人的行动，与任何人无关。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "好啦好啦，别紧张，你看我像是把你当成间谍的样子吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "是文月公主在把你送过来的时候特地和阿米娅通了一次电话。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#2",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "她当时就告诉阿米娅，说她虽然派你来确实没有额外的意图，但她害怕你会做多余的事，所以特地主动提醒我们稍微注意你一下。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "还给阿米娅讲了一下你的一些行动模式，所以我就姑且对你多上心一下啦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......这件事与公主无关。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "诶，你这人好难搞哦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "虽然我也觉得我的话没什么说服力啦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "不过你要是真的被认为是间谍的话，刚才在路上应该直接就被凯尔希干掉了哦？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "总之，念在你是初犯，你可以不用担心你会因为这件事受到惩罚或者牵连到你家公主什么的。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "不过我也确实不推荐你再用刚才那种方式在罗德岛上走来走去就是了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "一方面，核心区域你是绝对，绝——对进不去的，至少靠管道肯定不行。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "另一方面，窥探别人隐私也不是什么好事啦。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "而且你这样不累吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "不累。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "没有下次了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "然后去寻找别的方法是吗？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#4",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......我不保证。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#6",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "呜哇，好想把你丢给凯尔希，忠诚的人真是难搞。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "不过，反正凯尔希有一句话让我转告你，“你可以用你的方式观察罗德岛，但罗德岛也在观察你”。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......我知道了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "诶，其实你要是真的觉得晚上无聊想跑来跑去，可以来陪我一起看剧。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "看你刚才好像也对这方面有些研究的样子，罗德岛上大部分都是户外派，我都找不到几个同好，都要憋死了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "你在看的这部，确实没有再看下去的价值。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "我可以推荐一些，不知道你有没有。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "好啊好啊！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "可露希尔",
              "speakerToken": "char_007_closre_1#4",
              "operatorId": "char_007_closre",
              "portraitKey": "char_007_closre",
              "text": "你说说看，要是没有的话，我去找来我们一起看就是了！"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "白雪",
              "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki#5",
              "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
              "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
              "text": "......好。"
            },
            {
              "type": "sceneBreak"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "白雪",
          "speakerToken": "char_118_yuki",
          "operatorId": "char_118_yuki",
          "portraitKey": "char_118_yuki",
          "text": "......"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
